+# (only needed for static builds, which upstream's default/full/encodersgpl
+# flavors never exercise) — without it, ffmpeg's configure falls back to a
+# bare "ranlib" on $PATH, which doesn't exist in the Nix sandbox ("make:
+# ranlib: No such file or directory", hit in run 35198317213, 2026-09-17).
+# The cross-file already defines the real one (Xcode toolchain's ranlib) —
